    "On. Any device on your local network can connect to this iPhone over MIDI, and this iPhone can send MIDI out over the network." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On. Any device on your local network can connect to this iPhone over MIDI, and this iPhone can send MIDI out over the network."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off. No wireless MIDI in either direction." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Off. No wireless MIDI in either direction."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This iPhone accepts a MIDI connection from any device on your local network — a Mac's Network MIDI, rtpMIDI, or a compatible app — and appears to them as a wireless MIDI destination. Turn it off when you are on a network you do not control." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This iPhone accepts a MIDI connection from any device on your local network — a Mac's Network MIDI, rtpMIDI, or a compatible app — and appears to them as a wireless MIDI destination. Turn it off when you are on a network you do not control."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off. This iPhone does not announce itself for wireless MIDI: no incoming connection is accepted, and it no longer appears as a wireless MIDI destination, so MIDI out over the network stops too. Turn it on to play the instrument from a Mac, or to play a Mac from here, over the network." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Off. This iPhone does not announce itself for wireless MIDI: no incoming connection is accepted, and it no longer appears as a wireless MIDI destination, so MIDI out over the network stops too. Turn it on to play the instrument from a Mac, or to play a Mac from here, over the network."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On. Notes are spread across the MPE member channels, so a rig can bend and press each note on its own." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On. Notes are spread across the MPE member channels, so a rig can bend and press each note on its own."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off. Every note is sent on channel 1." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Off. Every note is sent on channel 1."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On. Each note carries the body's live Glide, Slide and Press." : {
      "localizations" : {
