    },
    "Unavailable while MPE note layout is off, because per-note expression needs one channel per note." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Unavailable while MPE note layout is off, because per-note expression needs one channel per note."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notes go out across the MPE member channels, each carrying the body's live Glide, Slide and Press. Point it at an MPE synth or a DAW track." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Notes go out across the MPE member channels, each carrying the body's live Glide, Slide and Press. Point it at an MPE synth or a DAW track."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notes go out across the MPE member channels. Turn on per-note expression to send the body's Glide, Slide and Press with each note." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Notes go out across the MPE member channels. Turn on per-note expression to send the body's Glide, Slide and Press with each note."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every note goes out on channel 1 — what any MIDI device understands. Turn on the MPE note layout to give each note its own channel; per-note expression needs that and stays unavailable until then." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every note goes out on channel 1 — what any MIDI device understands. Turn on the MPE note layout to give each note its own channel; per-note expression needs that and stays unavailable until then."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On. A second source, Echoelmusic (MIDI 2.0), carries the same notes with 16-bit velocity and 32-bit bend and controllers." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On. A second source, Echoelmusic (MIDI 2.0), carries the same notes with 16-bit velocity and 32-bit bend and controllers."
