    "Listening for /echoelmusic/ctrl/bpm (only while the BPM is locked) · key 0–11 · scale · genre · visualStyle 0–9 · blackout 0/1, and for ADM-OSC object positions /adm/obj/{n}/aed · xyz · azim · elev · dist · x · y · z · gain, where n is the piece's track in order. No bio value and no play/stop is accepted from the network. Turn it off on a network you do not control." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Listening for /echoelmusic/ctrl/bpm (only while the BPM is locked) · key 0–11 · scale · genre · visualStyle 0–9 · blackout 0/1, and for ADM-OSC object positions /adm/obj/{n}/aed · xyz · azim · elev · dist · x · y · z · gain, where n is the piece's track in order. No bio value and no play/stop is accepted from the network. Turn it off on a network you do not control."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on to let TouchDesigner, Resolume, QLab or a console send cues: /echoelmusic/ctrl/bpm (locked only) · key · scale · genre · visualStyle · blackout — and to let a spatial controller move each track over ADM-OSC (/adm/obj/{n}/…). Nothing else is accepted, and no socket is open while this is off." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turn on to let TouchDesigner, Resolume, QLab or a console send cues: /echoelmusic/ctrl/bpm (locked only) · key · scale · genre · visualStyle · blackout — and to let a spatial controller move each track over ADM-OSC (/adm/obj/{n}/…). Nothing else is accepted, and no socket is open while this is off."
          }
        }
      }
    },
