    "Arrange" : {
      "comment" : "Workstation redesign A7 (2026-10-01): the piece's tabs above the arrangement — Arrange is the plate itself; Mix and Export sit beside it. Every tab acts in place (slice B).",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
