    },
    "Every track as its own object (ADM-OSC)" : {
      "comment" : "Workstation redesign C4a (2026-10-01): Routing's ADM-OSC card — the switch that sends every track as its own spatial object instead of the one object that follows the music. Position and a fixed level only; nothing moves them yet; an empty piece sends nothing.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every track as its own object (ADM-OSC)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On. Each track of the piece is sent as its own ADM-OSC object at its starting place. Nothing moves them yet. With no track, nothing is sent." : {
      "comment" : "Workstation redesign C4a (2026-10-01): Routing's ADM-OSC card — the switch that sends every track as its own spatial object instead of the one object that follows the music. Position and a fixed level only; nothing moves them yet; an empty piece sends nothing.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On. Each track of the piece is sent as its own ADM-OSC object at its starting place. Nothing moves them yet. With no track, nothing is sent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off. ADM-OSC sends one object that follows the music." : {
      "comment" : "Workstation redesign C4a (2026-10-01): Routing's ADM-OSC card — the switch that sends every track as its own spatial object instead of the one object that follows the music. Position and a fixed level only; nothing moves them yet; an empty piece sends nothing.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Off. ADM-OSC sends one object that follows the music."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On: each track is one object at its starting place around the listener, numbered in track order — removing a track renumbers the ones after it. Position and a fixed level only, no audio. Nothing moves them yet. With no track, nothing is sent. Turns off when the app restarts." : {
      "comment" : "Workstation redesign C4a (2026-10-01): Routing's ADM-OSC card — the switch that sends every track as its own spatial object instead of the one object that follows the music. Position and a fixed level only; nothing moves them yet; an empty piece sends nothing.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On: each track is one object at its starting place around the listener, numbered in track order — removing a track renumbers the ones after it. Position and a fixed level only, no audio. Nothing moves them yet. With no track, nothing is sent. Turns off when the app restarts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off: one object follows the music. On sends every track instead, and nothing while the piece has no track. Either way it leaves the phone only once a route to ADM-OSC (spatial) is on." : {
      "comment" : "Workstation redesign C4a (2026-10-01): Routing's ADM-OSC card — the switch that sends every track as its own spatial object instead of the one object that follows the music. Position and a fixed level only; nothing moves them yet; an empty piece sends nothing.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Off: one object follows the music. On sends every track instead, and nothing while the piece has no track. Either way it leaves the phone only once a route to ADM-OSC (spatial) is on."
          }
        }
      }
    },
